    "subject": "Final Countdown: Lock in your ICAHCR 2026 seat today",
    "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n<title>ICAHCR 2026 — Final Countdown</title>\n<!--[if mso]>\n<noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript>\n<![endif]-->\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { background-color: #f4f6fb; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }\n  .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }\n  .countdown-bar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #4338ca 60%, #6d28d9 100%); padding: 26px 24px; text-align: center; }\n  .preheader { display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; color: #f4f6fb; }\n  .countdown-eyebrow { color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .countdown-title { color: #ffffff; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .countdown-sub { color: #e0e7ff; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; }\n  .logo-bar { background-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 22px 24px 16px; }\n  .logo-bar img { max-width: 140px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .logo-badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2e1065 0%, #4338ca 100%); color: #fbbf24; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; }\n  .nav-bar { background-color: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid #eef0f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef0f6; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; }\n  .nav-bar a { color: #4338ca; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; }\n  .content { padding: 36px 36px 16px; }\n  .greeting { color: #1e1b4b; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .lead { color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .countdown-banner { background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #fed7aa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; text-align: center; }\n  .countdown-banner .label { color: #c2410c; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .countdown-banner .big { color: #b91c1c; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; }\n  .countdown-banner .note { color: #9a3412; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .why-block { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #4338ca; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n  .why-block h4 { color: #1e1b4b; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .why-block ul { list-style: none; }\n  .why-block li { color: #334155; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 18px; position: relative; }\n  .why-block li::before { content: \"▸\"; color: #4338ca; position: absolute; left: 0; font-weight: 700; }\n  .pricing-block { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%); border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; text-align: center; }\n  .pricing-block .pricing-title { color: #c7d2fe; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .price-row { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .price-label { display: block; color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .price-amount { color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; }\n  .price-strike { color: #f87171; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: line-through; margin-left: 6px; }\n  .price-sub { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .cta-wrap { text-align: center; padding: 0 0 32px; }\n  .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4338ca 0%, #7c3aed 100%); color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding: 15px 40px; border-radius: 50px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n  .cta-sub { color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .agenda-section { padding: 8px 36px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #eef0f6; }\n  .agenda-section .section-title { color: #1e1b4b; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0 6px; }\n  .agenda-section .section-sub { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .agenda-day-label { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4338ca 0%, #7c3aed 100%); color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .agenda-item { border-left: 3px solid #e0e7ff; padding: 0 0 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; position: relative; }\n  .agenda-item::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: -6px; top: 4px; width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #4338ca; border-radius: 50%; }\n  .agenda-time { color: #4338ca; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .agenda-title { color: #1e293b; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .agenda-speaker { color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .agenda-link { text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .agenda-link a { color: #4338ca; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n  .footer { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%); padding: 28px 36px 18px; text-align: center; }\n  .footer-logo { max-width: 90px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 10px; display: block; }\n  .footer-conference-name { color: #ffffff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n  .footer-conf-date { color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .footer-badges { margin: 14px 0; }\n  .footer-badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #fbbf24; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 16px; margin: 0 3px; }\n  .footer-divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); margin: 18px 0 14px; }\n  .footer-links { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .footer-links a { color: #c7d2fe; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; display: inline-block; padding: 3px 8px; }\n  .footer-meta { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .footer-meta a { color: #a5b4fc; text-decoration: none; }\n  .sv-credit { color: #64748b; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; padding: 14px 36px 24px; background: #f4f6fb; }\n  @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .content, .agenda-section, .footer { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }\n    .countdown-title { font-size: 24px !important; }\n    .cta-btn { font-size: 15px !important; padding: 13px 28px !important; }\n    .nav-bar a { font-size: 11px !important; padding: 3px 5px !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\">\n\n        <!-- Preheader -->\n        <tr><td class=\"preheader\">Your paper is in. Don't miss the conference — seats are closing fast.</td></tr>\n\n        <!-- Countdown Hero -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"countdown-bar\">\n            <div class=\"countdown-eyebrow\">⏳ Final Countdown</div>\n            <div class=\"countdown-title\">THE CLOCK IS TICKING</div>\n            <div class=\"countdown-sub\">ICAHCR 2026 · AI in Healthcare & Clinical Research</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"logo-bar\">\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/\"><img src=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/assets/icahcr-logo.png\" alt=\"ICAHCR 2026\"></a>\n            <span class=\"logo-badge\">ScholarVault Verified · PLATINUM 92/100</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Nav -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"nav-bar\">\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/\">Home</a>\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/about\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda\">Agenda</a>\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/speakers\">Speakers</a>\n            <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\">Register</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"greeting\">Hi {{name}},</div>\n            <p class=\"lead\">Your paper is <strong>submitted and under review</strong> — the hard part is done. But there's one thing missing: your <strong>registration seat</strong>.</p>\n            <p class=\"lead\">ICAHCR 2026 begins <strong>August 22–23, 2026</strong>. Only <strong>9 days</strong> remain until researchers from over 20 countries meet online to shape the future of AI in healthcare. Your work deserves a stage — don't let your seat go to someone else.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"countdown-banner\">\n              <div class=\"label\">⏰ Registration Window Closing</div>\n              <div class=\"big\">9 Days Left to Register</div>\n              <div class=\"note\">Your paper is under review. Register now to lock in your presentation slot before seats fill.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"why-block\">\n              <h4>Why Register Now?</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>ISBN proceedings with permanent DOI for every paper</li>\n                <li>Best Paper, Best Presentation & Outstanding Research awards</li>\n                <li>ScholarVault Platinum 92/100 — anti-predatory verified</li>\n                <li>100% virtual · no travel · join from anywhere</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"pricing-block\">\n              <div class=\"pricing-title\">🎟️ Lock In Your Seat</div>\n              <div class=\"price-row\">\n                <span class=\"price-label\">Student / Scholar</span>\n                <span class=\"price-amount\">₹2,500</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"cta-wrap\">\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\" class=\"cta-btn\">Secure My Seat →</a>\n              <div class=\"cta-sub\">Priority registration for paper-submitted researchers</div>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Agenda -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"agenda-section\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">Conference Agenda</div>\n            <div class=\"section-sub\">Virtual · Live on Zoom · All times IST</div>\n\n            <div class=\"agenda-day-label\">Day 1 · August 22, 2026</div>\n\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">9:00 AM – 9:15 AM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Opening & Welcome</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Introduction by Moderator</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">9:15 AM – 10:00 AM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Keynote: How Institutional Verification Protects African Researchers</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Dr. Obioma Obikeze · CEO & World Bank Scholar, Nigeria</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">10:00 AM – 10:45 AM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Featured Talk: AI-Powered Drug Discovery for Unmet Medical Needs</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Dr. Pawan Saharan · Founder & CEO, Biomix AI Network Inc. (USA)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">10:45 AM – 11:00 AM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Short Break</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">11:00 AM – 11:45 AM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Keynote: Scaling SDG-Aligned AI Solutions in Healthcare</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Dr. C.R. Rene Robin · Sri Sairam Engineering College, Chennai</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">11:45 AM – 12:30 PM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Keynote: Engineering the Future — IoT & AI in Healthcare Infrastructure</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Ts. Dr. Iman Farshchi · MAHSA University, Malaysia</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">12:30 PM – 1:00 PM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Lunch & Networking</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">1:00 PM – 2:50 PM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Technical Session — Research Presentations & Q&A</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-speaker\">Slots still available for registered presenters</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n              <div class=\"agenda-time\">2:50 PM – 3:00 PM</div>\n              <div class=\"agenda-title\">Vote of Thanks & Closing</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"agenda-link\">\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda\">View Full Agenda →</a>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"footer\">\n            <img src=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/assets/icahcr-logo.png\" alt=\"ICAHCR 2026\" class=\"footer-logo\">\n            <div class=\"footer-conference-name\">ICAHCR 2026 · AI in Healthcare Conference</div>\n            <div class=\"footer-conf-date\">August 22–23, 2026 · Virtual / Online</div>\n            <div class=\"footer-badges\">\n              <span class=\"footer-badge\">ISBN Proceedings</span>\n              <span class=\"footer-badge\">Platinum 92/100</span>\n              <span class=\"footer-badge\">100% Virtual</span>\n            </div>\n            <hr class=\"footer-divider\">\n            <div class=\"footer-links\">\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/\">Home</a>\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/about\">About</a>\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda\">Agenda</a>\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/call-for-papers\">Call for Papers</a>\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/speakers\">Speakers</a>\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\">Register</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-meta\">\n              ICAHCR 2026 — ScholarVault Conference Series<br>\n              <a href=\"mailto:conferences@scholarvault.in\">conferences@scholarvault.in</a> ·\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/refund\">Refund Policy</a> ·\n              <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/privacy\">Privacy</a><br>\n              © 2026 ICAHCR — ScholarVault. All rights reserved.\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"sv-credit\">\n            You're receiving this email because you submitted a paper to ICAHCR 2026.<br>\n            Organized by <a href=\"https://scholarvault.in/\" style=\"color:#4338ca; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">ScholarVault</a> — India's verified academic conference platform.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "textBody": "ICAHCR 2026 — AI in Healthcare & Clinical Research\nScholarVault Verified · PLATINUM 92/100\nVirtual Conference · August 22–23, 2026\nHi {{name}},\nYour paper is submitted and under review — the hard part is done. But there's one thing missing: your registration seat.\nICAHCR 2026 begins August 22–23, 2026. Only 9 days remain until researchers from over 20 countries meet online to shape the future of AI in healthcare. Your work deserves a stage — don't let your seat go to someone else.\n⏰ REGISTRATION WINDOW CLOSING\n9 Days Left to Register\nYour paper is under review. Register now to lock in your presentation slot before seats fill.\nWHY REGISTER NOW?\n- ISBN proceedings with permanent DOI for every paper\n- Best Paper, Best Presentation & Outstanding Research awards\n- ScholarVault Platinum 92/100 — anti-predatory verified\n- 100% virtual · no travel · join from anywhere\nREGISTRATION\nStudent / Scholar: ₹2,500\nSecure your seat:\nhttps://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\n------------------------------------------------------------\nCONFERENCE AGENDA — Day 1 · August 22, 2026\nVirtual · Live on Zoom · All times IST\n------------------------------------------------------------\n9:00 AM – 9:15 AM\nOpening & Welcome\nIntroduction by Moderator\n9:15 AM – 10:00 AM\nKeynote: How Institutional Verification Protects African Researchers\nDr. Obioma Obikeze · CEO & World Bank Scholar, Healthnomics HMO Plc, Nigeria\n10:00 AM – 10:45 AM\nFeatured Talk: AI-Powered Drug Discovery for Unmet Medical Needs\nDr. Pawan Saharan · Founder & CEO, Biomix AI Network Inc. (USA)\n10:45 AM – 11:00 AM\nShort Break\n11:00 AM – 11:45 AM\nKeynote: Scaling SDG-Aligned AI Solutions in Healthcare\nDr. C.R. Rene Robin · Professor & Dean (Innovation), Sri Sairam Engineering College, Chennai\n11:45 AM – 12:30 PM\nKeynote: Engineering the Future — IoT & AI in Healthcare Infrastructure\nTs. Dr. Iman Farshchi · Dean, Faculty of Engineering & IT, MAHSA University, Malaysia\n12:30 PM – 1:00 PM\nLunch & Networking\n1:00 PM – 2:50 PM\nTechnical Session — Research Presentations & Q&A\nSlots still available for registered presenters\n2:50 PM – 3:00 PM\nVote of Thanks & Closing\nFull agenda: https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda\n------------------------------------------------------------\nQUICK LINKS\nRegister:      https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\nSubmit Paper:  https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/submit-paper\nSpeakers:      https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/speakers\nCall for Papers: https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/call-for-papers\nAbout:         https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/about\n------------------------------------------------------------\nICAHCR 2026 — ScholarVault Conference Series\nAugust 22–23, 2026 · Virtual / Online\nISBN Proceedings · DOI per paper · Open to all countries\nContact: conferences@scholarvault.in\nRefund Policy: https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/refund\nPrivacy Policy: https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/privacy\nYou're receiving this email because you submitted a paper to ICAHCR 2026.\nOrganized by ScholarVault — India's verified academic conference platform.\nhttps://scholarvault.in/\n© 2026 ICAHCR — ScholarVault. All rights reserved.",
